 ✅ Cosa È Completato

 ### Backend (100%)

 - Database: PostgreSQL 16 in Docker (localhost:5432, DB eshop, user eshop, password eshop123)
 - Entità: User, **Articles** (⚠ classe "Articles", non "Article"), Category, Cart, CartItem, Order, OrderItem, OrderPayment, PhoneNumber, Address
 - Relazioni:
     - User 1:1 Cart
     - User 1:N Order
     - User 1:N PhoneNumber
     - User 1:N Address
     - Cart 1:N CartItem
     - Order 1:N OrderItem
 - API REST complete su tutti gli endpoint (8 controller: Auth, Articles, Category, Cart, Order, User, Phone, Address)
 - Autenticazione: **JWT stateless** (access 1h + refresh 24h) + **BCrypt**
 - Rate limiting: login 30/min, register 10/min (sliding window in-memory)
 - CORS: configurato per null (file://), localhost, 127.0.0.1
 - Pagamento: PaymentGatewayService + MockPaymentGateway (checkout 2-step prepare→pay)
 - Test: **302/302 verdi** — suite rebuild S0–S4 (vedi `REBUILD_PLAN.md`); S5 (Playwright E2E) pendente

 ### Frontend (98% — UI/UX completato 2026-08-14)

 - Login/Registrazione funzionante
 - Catalogo prodotti con ricerca, filtri (categoria, prezzo, **ordinamento**)
 - Carrello (dropdown modale con overlay + screen modale centrato)
   → Overlay scuro 30% su tutto il contenuto quando dropdown aperto
   → Click sull'overlay chiude il modal
   → Cart item: allineamento perfetto con CSS Grid
   → Cart screen: modal centrato max-width 800px con backdrop 50%
   → Layout side-by-side: items a sx, riepilogo sticky a dx
 - Storico ordini
 - Pannello Admin (prodotti + ordini)
 - Impostazioni Account (Profilo, Telefoni, Indirizzi)
 - Design responsive con toast notifications (top:80px, z:9000)
 - Dark/Light theme con toggle
 - Auto-logout quando token JWT scaduto (checkAuth → GET /api/users/me)
 - Navigazione: listMenu fullscreen overlay (non confligge con .menu CSS)
 - Z-index hierarchy: cart-modal(100001) > overlay(100000) > menu(10000) > toast(9000)
 - Filter bar: gap 16px, label uniformi 0.8rem, senza uppercase
 - Order By dropdown: 7 opzioni (nome, prezzo, stock ± direzione)

 ### Database Schema

 ```
   users (id, username, email, password, role, created_at)
   articles (id, name, description, price, stock, category_id FK)
   carts (id, user_id FK)
   cart_items (id, cart_id FK, article_id FK, quantity, unit_price)
   categories (id, name, parent_id FK self)
   orders (id, user_id FK, status, total, payment_method, reserved_stock, order_date)
   order_items (id, order_id FK, article_id FK, quantity, unit_price)
   order_payments (id, order_id FK, payment_method, amount, status, transaction_id)
   phone_numbers (id, user_id FK, country_prefix, number, phone_type)
   addresses (id, user_id FK, street, street_number, postal_code, city, country)
 ```

